\title{Research of Hacon Christopher}
\maketitle

My research is mostly focoused on the birational geometry of algebraic varieties. I have been particularly interested in the birational geometry of irregular varieties and of linear systems on abelian varieties, in the birational geometry of surfaces and 3-folds and recently in natural questions on the birational geometry of higher dimensional varieties which naturally arise in teh context of the minimal model program.
